Regulatory & Red Flag Targets: Search for National Labor Relations Board (NLRB) unfair labor practice violations and complaints, Occupational Safety and Health Administration (OSHA) citations, workplace injury and fatality rates, and Department of Labor (DOL) wage-and-hour violations (such as unpaid overtime, off-the-clock work, or wage theft). Investigate employee walkouts, labor strikes, and WARN Act compliance during mass layoffs.